Title: Distributionally Robust Progressive Type-II Censoring Inference
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Okechukwu J.", "Obulezi", email = "oj.obulezi@unizik.edu.ng", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements distributionally robust optimization algorithms for progressive
    Type-II censored Weibull lifetime data under Wasserstein ambiguity balls.
    Provides primal-dual convex optimization solvers and robust inference bounds.
